        "committer": {
          "name": "Marc Vef",
          "email": "mvef@whamcloud.com",
          "date": "2026-08-26 12:34:39.000000000",
          "tz": 120
        },
        "subject": "LU-10026 tests: Add compression statistics output",
        "message": "LU-10026 tests: Add compression statistics output\n\nsanity-comr executes sanity, sanityn large set of its tests\n\nCurrently, it is not even easy to understand that data was\ncompressed/decompressed. Adding compression statists gives a sign\nthat compression is enabled and works, showing that parts\n(client/server, any features etc.) were executed during the test.\n\ntests: skip CSDC stats errors in interop\n\nThis also avoids trying to clear or fetch compression statistics\nfrom servers that do not support compression, always returning\nsuccess in that case.\nLet's avoid trying to clear or fetch these stats from servers that\ndo not have them and always return success when clear/read stats.\n\nDDN-bug-id: EX-10124\nWas-Change-Id: Ide3e69dfd0268041591c3445aff39532ff00f019\n\ntests: osc compr stats for all OSTs\n\nShow osc compression statistic for all OSTs in\nthe end of the test session.\n\nDDN-bug-id: EX-11007\nWas-Change-Id: Id6ae864438931d9ce50300911490760bf24dd88a\n\nTest-Parameters: forjanitoronly\nDDN-bug-id: EX-10124\nSigned-off-by: Artem Blagodarenko <ablagodarenko@ddn.com>\nSigned-off-by: Sergey Cheremencev <scherementsev@ddn.com>\nSigned-off-by: Marc Vef <mvef@whamcloud.com>\nChange-Id: I9856bad32b0f421ce8cb8ff45a171e229f7c8f02\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
